OL,3,AHundreds of thousands of students set
OL,4,Ato receive GCSE and BTec results
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe wait to open GCSE, BTec and
OL,7,FCambridge Nationals results is almost
OL,8,Fover for students in England, Wales and
OL,9,FNorthern Ireland
OL,11,FResults will be released at 08:00 BST -
OL,12,Fand from 11:00 BST, some pupils in
OL,13,FEngland can check them via an app for
OL,14,Fthe first time
OL,16,FAt one school in Derby, a red carpet
OL,17,Fhas been rolled out ready for students'
OL,18,Farrival
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
