OL,3,AHundreds of thousands of students set
OL,4,Ato receive GCSE and BTec results
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn 2025, the GCSE pass rate fell for
OL,7,Fthe fourth year running, to 67.4% -
OL,8,Fnational data for this year is expected
OL,9,Flater this morning
OL,11,FIn England, GCSEs are graded using a
OL,12,Fnumerical system from 9-1, while in
OL,13,FWales and Northern Ireland they are
OL,14,Fstill graded using letters from A* to U
OL,16,FStudents in Scotland have already
OL,17,Freceived their results, with the pass
OL,18,Frate up slightly on last year
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
